    "chunk_text": "\u00e6\u00f0 Nichodemus, la leof ge, Ysrahela bearn, hlysta\u00f0 me & uton gyt asendan on Ysrahela muntas Nychodemus ge\u00feeaht \u00fea lycode eallum \u00feam folce. & hig asendon \u00fea manige weras & \u00feone H\u00e6lend sohton & hyne secende nahwar ne fundon & hym We \u00feone H\u00e6lend nahwar ne gemetton. Ac we gemetton Ioseph on Arymathia hys agenre ceastre. \u00dea \u00f0a ealdras & \u00fea m\u00e6ssepreostas & eall \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00feys gehyrde \u00fea gef\u00e6gnodon hig & wuldor s\u00e6don \u00de\u00e6t folc worhte \u00fea mycele gesomnunga & heom betweonan cw\u00e6don, \u00fea ealdras & \u00fea m\u00e6ssepreostas, Hig \u00fea swa \u00feeah be\u00feohton \u00fe\u00e6t hig hym seofon weras gecuron \u00fee Iosepes frynd w\u00e6ron & hym to We wyton \u00fe\u00e6t we gesyngod habba\u00f0 \u00e6g\u00f0er ge on God ge on \u00fee. Ac we bydda\u00f0 \u00fee on eornest \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u gemedemige \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu cume to \u00feynum f\u00e6derum & to \u00feynum We wyton \u00fe\u00e6t we awyrgedlic ge\u00feanc ongean \u00fee \u00f0ohton. Ac Dryhten \u00fee onfeng & \u00fee alysde of urum awyrgedlicum ge\u00feeahte. Ac syb sig myd \u00fee Ioseph & gearwur\u00f0od wur\u00f0 \u00feu fram eallum folce. \u00dea \u00e6rendracan \u00fea foron & to Iosepe comon & hyne gesybsumlice gretton & heora gewryt hym on And \u00fea Ioseph \u00fe\u00e6t gewryt r\u00e6dde \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, Sig gebletsod se Dryhten God se\u00f0e me alysde & myn & sig",
